{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/825991-crossover-couples","id":825991,"title":"Crossover Couples","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-02-08T08:02:23-08:00","id":825991,"title":"Crossover Couples","content":"Excuse: Valentine's Day is around the corner.<br /> <br /> Rules: Two (or more?) Significant Others from different game-lines, major or minor. So Wolf-blooded and Vampire is fine, but Ghoul and Vampire is not. Blue Books are fine.<br /> <br /> So, what diverse pairings have you encountered (or thought up right here), and how did their different origins/themes interact?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-08T08:13:02-08:00","id":825997,"title":"","content":"As I'm mentioned in another thread, one of my games currently has a Sin-Eater/Changeling couple coming up. The player's already saving XP for the True Friend merit. Also, one of my players rolled the Wheel of Fate and got &quot;character falls in love&quot;, so there's a Sin-Eater/Hunter romance in the wings as well. Oh, and if one of my players goes for it, there may be a Sin-Eater/Vampire brief but torrid affair at some point. There's also been some Werewolf/Sin-Eater flirting between them.<br /> <br /> Other pairings I've seen in my previous games were Changeling/Vampire and Werewolf/Hunter.","signature