d to be in said buildings. The father, however, didn't know that his daughter was getting involved in the hunt as well. To make matters worse another player, her childhood friend, decided to be wolf-blooded. So the father pulled all the strings he could to get the kid out of the picture and the boyfriend was irrationally mean to the wolf-blooded, 'knowing' something was wrong with him but not being able to put a finger on it. Weird love triangle there with half conversions and a minor template.<br /> <br /> In our ghoul-turned-vampire game we had a twisted ghoul x hunter relationship that turned into an abusive vampire x hunter relationship.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-08T11:14:24-08:00","id":826077,"title":"","content":"Mages can fuck everything. That's a fact. Indeed, they do fuck everything.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":6851,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6851-sangros","user":"Sangros","date":". 02-08-2016, 05:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6851-sangros","name":"Sangros","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6851_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"24"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-08T11:32:18-08:00","id":826095,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\">