eg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-29T15:22:46-08:00","id":839471,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/825991-crossover-couples?p=839361#post839361\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Until Disquiet sets in, of course.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmmmm, if the Ordo Dracul can overcome the limits of vampirism...I wonder what a Promethean could do with their research and methods?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-29T16:32:45-08:00","id":839517,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/825991-crossover-couples?p=828346#post828346\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One I'm currently developing as side characters:<br /> <br /> Demon + Mummy. The Demon uses the Mummy's cult as shelter and an asset, while the Mummy leverages the Demon's perfect recall. From this originally business arrangement, something more developed. Still hammering out the details and some missing historical bits.</div> </div> </div> </div>Similarly, in my game, there's a &quot;relationship&quot; between a Mummy and an ANGEL. They seem like the perfect couple. He remembers her fondly when he wakes. Problem is, she has trained him to remember her as his longtime wife. She has manipulated his memory into a loop, where he doesn't realize how badly he's been duped.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/935-cleverest-of-things","name":"Cleverest of Things","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar935_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"650"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-29T16:38:33-08:00","id":839524,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/825991-crossover-couples?p=839471#post839471\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmmmm, if the Ordo Dracul can overcome the limits of vampirism...I wonder what a Promethean could do with their research and methods?</div> </div> </div> </div>To be reasonable about it, the Ordo Dracul has had hundreds, if not thousands of vampires working on the issue for hundreds of years and recording that knowledge, and their overcoming of limits is still really limited. Prometheans don't generally have the same infrastructure in that regard.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-29T16:46:33-08:00","id":839531,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/825991-crossover-couples?p=839524#post839524\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To be reasonable about it, the Ordo Dracul has had hundreds, if not thousands of vampires working on the issue for hundreds of years and recording that knowledge, and their overcoming of limits is still really limited. Prometheans don't generally have the same infrastructure in that regard.</div> </div> </div> </div>Also, even if you set aside the matters of the various types of good and bad luck that Prometheans tend to run into during their existences, they don't have the benefit of actual stopped-clock agelessness-type immortality to let them devote a century or more to the process of indefinitely containing the unpredictable chunk of Change that animates them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-29T17:33:03-08:00","id":839556,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Illuminated Minutia</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/825991-crossover-couples?p=835382#post835382\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This, except they both fall in love at the end <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/redface.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Embarrassment\" smilieid=\"2\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div> LMFAO, who doesn't love a happy ending, especially with demonic fetch childern as Vent0 suggested.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-29T17:34:59-08:00","id":839557,"title":"","content":"Or a Dream Incubus has a child with a human, creating a Cambion, and the human end up a demon cover, creating a half demon Cambion, a total hedge nightmare.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-29T17:37:31-08:00","id":839558,"title":"","content":"A Demon/Genius couple who proceed to wreck basically everybody's shit. (Especially since, in my headcanon, Geniuses tap into God-Machine Occult Physics).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-29T17:39:22-08:00","id":839559,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/825991-crossover-couples?p=839531#post839531\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, even if you set aside the matters of the various types of good and bad luck that Prometheans tend to run into during their existences, they don't have the benefit of actual stopped-clock agelessness-type immortality to let them devote a century or more to the process of indefinitely containing the unpredictable chunk of Change that animates them.</div> </div> </div> </div>On the other hand/tentacle, that very same Change seems ideally suited for breaking limits on things.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-29T17:42:49-08:00","id":839560,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/825991-crossover-couples?p=839557#post839557\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Or a Dream Incubus has a child with a human, creating a Cambion, and the human end up a demon cover, creating a half demon Cambion, a total hedge nightmare.</div> </div> </div> </div>Who then gets into a co-dependent relationship with a Dominion (see Inferno). They both say they'll never do it again. They're both lying. Neither can tell.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/825991-crossover-couples?p=839558#post839558\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A Demon/Genius couple who proceed to wreck basically everybody's shit. (Especially since, in my headcanon, Geniuses tap into God-Machine Occult Physics).</div> </div> </div> </div>Go, go Gadget-Wonders! That <i>that</i> conventional physics!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-29T22:07:04-08:00","id":839691,"title":"","content":"I've had a couple of these, admittedly. Two were Mage/Sin-Eater; the first was the two of them happening across each other once they were already supers and falling for each other. The other was the more interesting of the two, in my opinion. He was originally a Sleepwalker who married his Awakened wife after he helped out her cabal when they chased some cryptid through the school he was working in, and they had a daughter. However, the city's consilium fell to the Seers of the Throne and, as far as she knew, the Seers killed him in cold blood while making her watch through a scrying window. He made the Bargain and survived, but ended up in the Underworld for about a year due to his Geist owing someone Down Below some time in a body, as it were. Thinking that he was dead and gone his wife set out to track down and kill the Seers that 'murdered' him, going Austere in the process. Things got...interesting when he came back to the surface about the same time she came back to town to nail the final Seer, although we didn't get to play them together for too much longer after that due to RL stuff popping up, which was a pity.<br /> <br /> The one I'm playing currently is a Wolf/Ling pair, where the wolf was originally tasked with helping the ling adjust to the modern world after popping back in about seventy years after he left; the wolf's alpha is the ling's grandson, which made the courting process between the two rather entertaining.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Pay no attention to the man behind the Storyteller!&quot; <hr /><a href=\"https://www.fromdusktilljawn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">From Dusk 'til Jawn</a> - 2e nWoD game set in Philadelphia<br /> <a href=\"http://www.gravenlore.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Graven Lore</a> - 2e multi-venue nWoD game<br /> <a href=\"http://newhaven.mindrealms.com/\" target=\"_blank\">New Haven</a> - 2e nWoD game set in southern Maine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/951-caelene","name":"Caelene","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar951_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"54"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-01T14:37:54-08:00","id":840182,"title":"","content":"Another duo of characters, primarily designed for a research project, but easily recastable as a (twisted, probably villainous) couple:<br /> <br /> A Goetic summoning Mage (likely Bene Ashmedi) and a Psychic Vampire (see the Hurt Lock previews). The PsiVamp uses Psychic Seduction to change a target/subject/victim's Vice to something interesting, then the Mage summons forth a Goetic incarnation of that Vice.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-06T11:31:29-07:00","id":860453,"title":"","content":"A Mekhet/Stricken. The mekhet needed a certain artifact for her sire and the stricken was the owner, long story short, a football stadium was destroyed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11165-tangledvirus","name":"TangledVirus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11165_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-30T15:26:58-07:00","id":1482411,"title":"","content":"Here's a trio of ideas I've either had in my head for at least a bit, or just thought of. Though, before I start going over them, please note that, in spite of whatever words I use, all individuals are to be assumed to be in the exact same age-range as each other.<br /> <br /> Demon/Beast; Both in spite, and because, of the animosity between the two races, I cannot help but wonder as to what series of events would lead to such a union, and what sort of antics they could get up to. Certainly, a sufficiently potent begotten's lair could easily act as a pseudo-/substitute bolthole for one of the unchained in dire enough straits.<br /> <br /> Beast/Noble: Both are splats connected to fear in some capacity, with beasts feeding upon it, and princes(sess) working to combat it. Assuming that a member of each splat could get an understanding of beasthood across to the noble, the resultant teamwork of the two seeking to guide people to the heights of who they can be could be an absolutely <b><i>perfect</i></b> springboard for a romantic relationship.<br /> <br /> Noble/<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless\">Monarch</a>: Both splats are connected by the string(s) of leadership, with a noble being able to rise as the King or Queen of a nation, whilst a Monarch already <i>is</i> the leader of such, albeit a rather despotic one. I can just imagine it; one of the enlightened, almost on the verge of becoming royalty of their own nation, somehow meets one of the earth-origined Endless and they somehow get into a talk about being a leader. Enjoying the debate, they decide to meet up again, and again, and again, unwittingly falling for each other and not realising it until its explicitely pointed out to them both.<br /> <br /> Noble/<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/873174-dragon-rekindled-the-orobori-chronicles-embers-reboot\">Ouroboros</a> or <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/451589-dragon-the-inheritance\">Inheritor</a>: Do I really have to explain this one? A prince(ess) and a dragon(ess), courting and laying one another where kidnapping and slaying would be when it came to fairy tales. Could be easily turned up to eleven if the noble is of a bardic character, or the Ouroboros/Heir more akin to a roguish, dashing knight in mannerisms.<br /> <br /> Yes, I am aware that this is most likely necromancy, but please give this post some thought.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-30T21:07:24-07:00","id":1482456,"title":"","content":"<b><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">TerrorCooper, please stop reviving threads over a year old.</span></b>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/ony